      <h1 data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="700" data-aos-delay="100">What Is an Ionizing Bar? How It Works & When to Use One</h1>
      <p>
        An ionizing bar is a passive static elimination device used in industrial manufacturing.
        It emits balanced positive and negative ions to neutralize electrostatic charge on moving surfaces — without physical contact.
      </p>
